bola centered at $(h,k)$ is\n\n$$\n\\frac{(x-h)^{2}}{{a}^{2}}-\\frac{(y-k)^{2}}{{b}^{2}}=1.\n$$\n\nFor a horizontal hyperbola, the equations of the asymptotes are\n\n$$\ny-k=\\pm \\frac{b}{a}(x-h).\n$$\n\nIn our case, we have \n\n$$\n(h,k)=(0,-2),\\,a=\\sqrt{16}=4,\\,b=\\sqrt{9}=3.\n$$\n\n \n\nTherefore, the asymptotes are given by\n\n$$\ny+2=\\pm \\frac{3}{4}x.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-10472/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "c96e6d6f-22be-5bfd-b24e-be9e34fcb149"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-10472"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-165470/selection/ecc59fbb88ae9666810d16c4bebd8c0674b400ab6612da98cd416b5136fe448d" :answer/id #uuid "b664977d-3498-5110-b62b-29096d0986f1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y-2=\\pm \\frac{1}{4}(x+2)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-165470/selection/9c3052d326753cc02212dc1f14475c21159fea4cf81d9f1a1faeea113642eb25" :answer/id #uuid "141f4379-0020-535c-9a73-6d32b2c4a648" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y-4=\\pm 2(x+2)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-165470/selection/d8dec5b4e93c96cbd54693322975de27fe1e19b409fcc1cc8497289a4dd0e68d" :answer/id #uuid "6ccd7295-f60b-52a5-bca5-208b8f37a52b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y+2=\\pm \\frac{1}{2}(x-4)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-165470/selection/2c37a1b039faafe812a66998952eae776feab437d36c7fe76511748664b8d20b" :answer/id #uuid "0d801b43-9d32-5779-9c24-3e20300f86a2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y+2=\\pm 2(x-2)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-165470/selection/83f44d01b96e3cb64b603541fdc42938cb30af5d987d481bf6a0f8c7596da276" :answer/id #uuid "109adc47-074c-5036-9bd9-7f8e12dd324f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y+2=\\pm \\frac{1}{2}(x-2)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-165470/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "75099df9-a9a2-50ab-ad37-4000e1c51e6e" :answe